  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRANT FOR EMERGENCY PROGRAMMES TO ADDRESS HUNGER &amp;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Emergency Programme to Address Hunger and Malnutrition in Maputsoe District, Lesotho, implemented by Action Lesotho CLG, aims to combat hunger and malnutrition in the area. The grant seeks to increase the number of people receiving soft porridge from 100 to 200 daily and expand the infant nutrition programme from 50 to 60 children. It also aims to feed starving families and encourage beneficiaries to grow their own vegetables using sack gardens and raised beds. Additionally, the programme will provide regular nutrition packages to increase the number of infants reached and help prevent or reverse malnutrition and stunting in young children.</narrative>
  </description>
